      "message": "Do you plan to have follow-up CLs that enable this support on specific boards?\n\nAs is, I think this might cause test coverage to drop on herobrine because you have the test configured to cover shim/buttons.c, but the EC image built on herobrine still compiles in common/power_button.c",
