      "writtenOn": "2023-01-09T15:18:00Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I do anticipate volume buttons to be added at some point.  Mainly because all gpio_keys under `gpio_keys0` share the same `buttons_cb_handler` callback.  I could split off the power_button specific code into its own file and have a directory structure like\n```\nzephyr/shim/buttons/buttons.c\nzephyr/shim/buttons/power_button.c\nzephyr/shim/buttons/recovery_button.c\nzephyr/shim/buttons/volume_buttons.c\n```\n\nWhen new button support is needed we add to `buttons_cb_handler`. Is there any expectation to handle a lot of buttons?  If so I can update the buttons.c code to dynamically register handlers per `zephyr_code`.\n\nThoughts?",
      "parentUuid": "461ec592_40149995",
      "revId": "dedab85213244de4b6a23383ba5296a1c658e31e",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
